msgstr[0] "Wenn Sie einem Partnerlink folgen, wird ein Affiliate-Cookie (wpac_ref, %d Tag) gesetzt."
msgstr[1] "Wenn Sie einem Partnerlink folgen, wird ein Affiliate-Cookie (wpac_ref, %d Tage) gesetzt."

msgid "After a purchase via a partner, later purchases within %d day are also credited to this partner. For this we store a keyed hash of your customer account and e-mail address, not the address itself."
msgid_plural "After a purchase via a partner, later purchases within %d days are also credited to this partner. For this we store a keyed hash of your customer account and e-mail address, not the address itself."
